# Copy to .env and adjust. Never commit .env (DOCUMENT 20 §11).

NODE_ENV=development

# PostgreSQL — matches docker-compose.yml.
#
# DATABASE_URL is the running application's own connection — the restricted
# `ufuq_app` role, bound by row-level security (AD-03, Phase 3 migration). It
# is never the bootstrap superuser: request-handling code must not be able to
# bypass tenant isolation even in principle.
#
# DATABASE_MIGRATION_URL is the bootstrap superuser, used only by
# `prisma migrate` and `prisma/seed.ts` — schema changes and reference-data
# seeding are operator actions, not something the API does while serving
# traffic. It is not read by `apps/api` at all.
#
# `ufuq_app`'s password here is set by `prisma/seed.ts` (see that file) the
# first time it runs against a fresh database — until then, DATABASE_URL
# will not authenticate. Both passwords are local-only, matching this
# repository's existing convention for `docker-compose.yml` (never a
# production secret — DOCUMENT 20 §11).
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://ufuq_app:ufuq_app_local_password@localhost:5432/ufuq
DATABASE_MIGRATION_URL=postgresql://ufuq:ufuq_local_password@localhost:5432/ufuq

# Redis — BullMQ queues (AD-01)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# S3-compatible private object storage (AD-02) — MinIO locally
STORAGE_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:9000
STORAGE_REGION=us-east-1
STORAGE_BUCKET=ufuq-local
STORAGE_ACCESS_KEY_ID=ufuq_local_access_key
STORAGE_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=ufuq_local_secret_key
STORAGE_FORCE_PATH_STYLE=true
# DOCUMENT 20 §7 — largest accepted upload, in bytes. Default 10 MB (10485760).
STORAGE_MAX_UPLOAD_BYTES=10485760

# SMTP for transactional authentication and Phase 16 public contact mail.
# The employee invitation email
# (DOCUMENT 09 §6, approved Phase 5 decision). Locally this is Mailpit from
# docker-compose.yml: nothing leaves the machine, and every message is
# readable at http://localhost:8025. SMTP_USER and SMTP_PASSWORD are set
# together or not at all; SMTP_SECURE=true means implicit TLS (port 465).
# Phase 16 public contact recipient. Local Mailpit only; supply a real value at deployment.
CONTACT_TO=contact@ufuq.local
SMTP_HOST=localhost
SMTP_PORT=1025
SMTP_SECURE=false
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASSWORD=
MAIL_FROM="Ufuq <no-reply@ufuq.local>"

# Application
API_PORT=4000
WEB_PORT=3000
WEB_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3000

# Where the browser reaches the API. The web client and the API are separate
# origins, so `apps/web` calls the API directly with credentials and the API
# allows exactly `WEB_ORIGIN` through CORS (see apps/api/src/main.ts). This is
# a `NEXT_PUBLIC_` variable because the value is used by the browser, so it
# must never hold anything secret — it is a public URL, nothing more.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=http://localhost:4000
